<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Archer Daniels raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Archer Daniels raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it upgraded Archer Daniels Midland Co to accumulate from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We now believe that most of the bad news concerning fundamentals, excess capacity, ethanol, and return on capital are in the stock,&quot; NatWest said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at 17-3/4.</p>
</text>
